{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevKSC2gVhYZUrSofZR8a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me verify the implementation in detail:\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - `BUILD SUCCESS`, total time 4.111s\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All 13 existing tests still pass (4 OrderControllerTest + 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests + 5 ShipmentControllerTest + 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels an active order** - Test: `cancels an active order and returns 200 with cancelled order` ✓\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent** - Uses existing ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) patterns\n5. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds; blocked by CONFIRMED changes nothing; unknown order refused; shipment for cancelled order refused**:\n   - Test: `cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds idempotently` ✓\n   - Test: `rejects cancellation with 409 if a confirmed shipment exists` ✓\n   - Test: `returns 404 when cancelling a non-existent order` ✓\n   - Test: `rejects shipment creation for a cancelled order with 409` ✓\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** - pom.xml unchanged\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only modified order and shipment features and api package\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **Order.kt** - Added `OrderStatus` enum (ACTIVE, CANCELLED) and `status` field to Order data class. Necessary for tracking order lifecycle.\n\n2. **OrderRepository.kt** - No changes needed. Existing methods support the cancel workflow.\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** - Added `findByOrderId(orderId: String)` method. Necessary to find shipments belonging to an order during cancellation.\n\n4. **OrderController.kt** - Added:\n   - Import of ShipmentRepository and ShipmentStatus\n   - Constructor parameter for ShipmentRepository\n   - `cancel(@PathVariable orderId: String)` e